Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- expo ~58.0.21 and every SDK module per `expo install --fix`; RN 0.86.3 → 0.88.0, React 19.3.0,
  gesture-handler 3.3, reanimated 4.7.1, worklets 0.13, screens 4.30, webview 14.0.1, babel-preset-expo 58.
- InteractionManager (removed in RN 0.88) → src/afterInteractions.ts (requestIdleCallback, same { cancel } shape).
- Strict RN types: refs use ViewInstance / TextInputInstance / ScrollViewInstance; List*Component get undefined
  instead of null; webview 14 typing pinned with WebView<object>.
- R8 stays off on Android for this release (plugins/withNoMinify.js) — SDK 58 turns it on by default.
- iOS: SDK 58 prebuild generates the UIKit SceneDelegate iOS 27 requires; the EAS auto image is Xcode 27.1,
  so the iPhone extra-large widget family (D-1500) compiles in.
- Version 1.13.0. Native build required.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
